Description: tiny pastel Pomodoro timer
 Manbo is a small Pomodoro timer with pastel themes and a big, squishy
 3D start button. Focus, short break, long break and the long break
 interval are all configurable. Includes a mini always-on-top mode, a
 D-Bus API and a KDE Plasma 6 widget.
